ng \u1ea1?\` c\u00f4 b\u00e9 h\u1ecfi \u0111i h\u1ecfi l\u1ea1i.`},{`en`:`\`Grandpa, [[are|be]] [[there]] [[lions|lion]] [[here]]? [[Or]] [[elephants|elephant]]?\` Grandpa [[laughs|laugh]]. \`[[No]] [[lions|lion]], [[no]] [[elephants|elephant]]. [[But]] [[I]] [[have]] [[a]] [[cat]]. [[She]] [[thinks|think]] [[she]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[lion]].\` [[The]] [[small]] [[grey]] [[cat]] [[looks|look]] [[at]] Nhung. [[The]] [[cat]] [[is|be]] [[not]] [[afraid]] [[of]] [[anything]].`,`vn`:`\`\u00d4ng \u01a1i, \u1edf \u0111\u00e2y c\u00f3 s\u01b0 t\u1eed kh\u00f4ng? Hay voi?\` \u00d4ng b\u1eadt c\u01b0\u1eddi. \`Kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 s\u01b0 t\u1eed, c\u0169ng ch\u1eb3ng c\u00f3 voi. Nh\u01b0ng \u00f4ng c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t con m\u00e8o. N\u00f3 c\u1ee9 t\u01b0\u1edfng n\u00f3 l\u00e0 s\u01b0 t\u1eed.\` Con m\u00e8o x\u00e1m nh\u1ecf nh\u00ecn Nhung. N\u00f3 ch\u1eb3ng s\u1ee3 g\u00ec c\u1ea3.`},{`en`:`[[In]] [[the]] [[evening]], Grandpa [[makes|make]] [[a]] [[fire]]. [[The]] [[sun]] [[goes|go]] [[down]] [[behind]] [[the]] [[mountain]], [[and]] [[the]] [[stars|star]] [[come]] [[out]]. [[In]] [[the]] [[city]], Nhung [[sees|see]] [[only]] [[two]] [[or]] [[three]] [[stars|star]]. [[Here]] [[there]] [[are|be]] [[a]] [[thousand]].`,`vn`:`Bu\u1ed5i t\u1ed1i, \u00f4ng nh\u00f3m m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed1ng l\u1eeda. M\u1eb7t tr\u1eddi l\u1eb7n sau n\u00fai, v\u00e0 c\u00e1c v\u00ec sao hi\u1ec7n ra. \u1ede th\u00e0nh ph\u1ed1, Nhung ch\u1ec9 th\u1ea5y hai ba ng\u00f4i sao. \u1ede \u0111\u00e2y c\u00f3 t\u1edbi c\u1ea3 ngh\u00ecn.`},{`en`:`\`[[Everything]] [[here]] [[is|be]] [[natural]],\` [[says|say]] Grandpa. [[That]] [[night]], Nhung [[is|be]] [[in]] [[bed]] [[with]] [[the]] [[window]] [[open]]. [[Then]] [[something]] [[moves|move]] [[under]] [[her]] [[bed]].`,`vn`:`\`\u1ede \u0111\u00e2y m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 \u0111\u1ec1u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ea3,\` \u00f4ng n\u00f3i. \u0110\u00eam \u0111\u00f3, Nhung n\u1eb1m tr\u00ean gi\u01b0\u1eddng, c\u1eeda s\u1ed5 \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1edf. B\u1ed7ng c\u00f3 c\